WEBVTT

00:14.920 --> 00:17.750
[Pangzhou Huangsha Station]

01:16.789 --> 01:18.380
Someone's dead!

03:16.760 --> 03:20.470
[A Prophet]

03:21.190 --> 03:23.410
[Episode 4]

03:26.079 --> 03:27.250
Is it done?

03:27.760 --> 03:28.600
It's done.

03:33.079 --> 03:33.880
What's wrong?

03:35.320 --> 03:36.520
You don't look happy.

03:39.640 --> 03:41.100
Whether it's Old Madam Zhu

03:41.570 --> 03:42.640
or Lyu Ruhui,

03:43.970 --> 03:45.570
they got what they deserved.

03:46.480 --> 03:49.010
But hurting someone completely innocent...

03:49.480 --> 03:50.320
I'm afraid

03:52.450 --> 03:54.450
I'll become more and more like them.

03:57.200 --> 03:59.600
Once we decided
to go after the Tianxiang Sect,

03:59.600 --> 04:01.060
there was no turning back.

04:03.200 --> 04:04.040
I know.

04:05.920 --> 04:07.780
We've been preparing for this day

04:11.600 --> 04:13.760
for far too long.

04:20.350 --> 04:25.770
[Eight years ago]

04:20.490 --> 04:21.279
Mentor,

04:21.610 --> 04:23.300
I just can't make heads or tails of
the incantations in the Yingyao Rhapsody,

04:23.300 --> 04:25.300
no matter how many times I read them.

04:25.400 --> 04:26.400
It's all coded language.

04:26.400 --> 04:28.400
No wonder you can't make sense of it.

04:28.720 --> 04:29.650
This first line:

04:29.840 --> 04:31.200
"upon meeting a client,
discern their intent;

04:31.200 --> 04:33.010
when you speak, don't hesitate."

04:33.010 --> 04:35.280
It means that
when you're telling someone's fortune,

04:35.280 --> 04:36.890
you should listen more than you speak,

04:36.890 --> 04:38.490
then seize the right moment
to hit the nail on the head,

04:38.490 --> 04:38.890
right?

04:39.080 --> 04:39.640
Exactly.

04:40.400 --> 04:41.860
But the next four lines...

04:42.200 --> 04:43.610
These next four lines

04:43.610 --> 04:45.409
are all about the wisdom of life.

04:46.010 --> 04:47.810
You need to look and reflect—

04:47.960 --> 04:49.400
to look at all things,

04:49.420 --> 04:51.540
understand life's joys and sorrows,

04:52.280 --> 04:53.370
and observe.

04:54.370 --> 04:55.280
Observe?

05:12.580 --> 05:13.580
Bamboo baskets!

05:13.610 --> 05:14.890
Check it out.

05:14.890 --> 05:16.520
Freshly woven bamboo baskets!

05:16.520 --> 05:18.160
Big ones, small ones—

05:18.450 --> 05:19.160
take a look!

05:19.370 --> 05:20.200
Come get one!

05:30.840 --> 05:33.370
Upon meeting a client,
discern their intent;

05:33.520 --> 05:35.320
when you speak, don't hesitate.

05:35.640 --> 05:38.570
If a father asks about his son,
he wants to know if his son will prosper.

05:38.570 --> 05:41.159
If a father asks about his son,
he wants to know if his son will prosper.

05:41.159 --> 05:44.280
If a son asks about his father,
he's worried about his father's health.

05:44.280 --> 05:47.450
If a son asks about his father,
he's worried about his father's health.

05:47.450 --> 05:49.720
If a parent comes
to have their child's fortune told,

05:49.720 --> 05:52.840
they're usually asking whether the child
will make something of himself

05:52.840 --> 05:54.890
and lead a life of wealth and success.

05:54.890 --> 05:58.020
When a child comes
to have their parent's fortunes told,

05:58.280 --> 06:00.610
it's always because the parent
is in poor health—

06:00.610 --> 06:02.740
whether they're ill or nearing death.

06:03.110 --> 06:06.690
Those are the things children worry about
most when it comes to their parents.

06:06.690 --> 06:08.280
A wife asks about her husband.

06:08.280 --> 06:09.130
A wife asks about her husband.

06:09.130 --> 06:11.890
Those who come happily hope
to share in their husbands' success.

06:11.890 --> 06:13.160
Those who come happily hope
to share in their husbands' success.

06:13.160 --> 06:15.930
Those who come sorrowfully
are truly worried about their husbands.

06:15.930 --> 06:17.720
Those who come sorrowfully
are truly worried about their husbands.

06:17.720 --> 06:18.840
When a wife

06:19.080 --> 06:21.570
comes to ask about her husband's future,

06:21.720 --> 06:23.320
if she comes in high spirits,

06:23.490 --> 06:24.620
it means her husband

06:24.640 --> 06:26.770
may soon rise in rank or make a fortune.

06:27.000 --> 06:29.400
But if she looks troubled,

06:29.760 --> 06:32.520
either her husband
has lost his position or fortune,

06:32.520 --> 06:35.080
or he's thinking of leaving her.

06:36.320 --> 06:37.320
A husband asks about his wife.

06:37.320 --> 06:38.159
A husband asks about his wife.

06:38.159 --> 06:39.280
If the matter doesn't involve the wife,

06:39.280 --> 06:40.320
If the matter doesn't involve the wife,

06:40.320 --> 06:42.840
it must be about difficulties
having children.

06:42.840 --> 06:45.010
it must be about difficulties
having children.

06:45.010 --> 06:46.159
A man

06:46.370 --> 06:48.250
who comes to have his wife's fortune told

06:48.250 --> 06:50.080
does so for only two possible reasons.

06:50.080 --> 06:50.490
Either

06:50.890 --> 06:53.080
he suspects she's been unfaithful,

06:53.280 --> 06:54.450
or they're having trouble

06:54.450 --> 06:55.760
having children.

06:56.320 --> 06:59.580
Otherwise, a man would never
have his wife's fortune told.

07:00.610 --> 07:02.410
A scholar asks about his future.

07:02.450 --> 07:03.840
A scholar asks about his future.

07:03.840 --> 07:06.130
A wealthy man asks
about his remaining years.

07:06.130 --> 07:07.720
A wealthy man asks
about his remaining years.

07:07.720 --> 07:08.690
This means

07:09.010 --> 07:11.200
scholars usually ask
about their prospects—

07:11.200 --> 07:12.610
whether they'll pass the exams

07:12.610 --> 07:14.570
and whether they'll become officials.

07:14.570 --> 07:15.840
As for the wealthy,

07:15.960 --> 07:17.960
they always ask about their longevity.

07:17.960 --> 07:19.520
They have plenty of money

07:19.640 --> 07:20.760
and fear nothing

07:20.780 --> 07:22.510
except not living long enough.

07:23.050 --> 07:24.810
Those high-ranking officials...

07:24.810 --> 07:25.930
Those high-ranking officials...

07:25.930 --> 07:27.490
Claim to have their hearts set
on the mountains and forests.

07:27.490 --> 07:28.840
Claim to have their hearts set
on the mountains and forests.

07:28.840 --> 07:30.570
Those high-ranking officials

07:30.570 --> 07:32.040
actually have greater ambitions

07:32.040 --> 07:33.220
and stronger desires for personal gain.

07:33.220 --> 07:35.200
If I tempt them with wealth and power,

07:35.200 --> 07:36.860
they'll surely be delighted.

07:37.050 --> 07:38.610
You're a quick learner.

07:39.159 --> 07:41.159
So you must observe carefully

07:41.330 --> 07:43.790
and read the present situation accurately.

07:43.850 --> 07:46.640
Tomorrow, I'll set up my stall
and tell fortunes.

07:47.250 --> 07:48.760
You come along and watch.

07:54.520 --> 07:55.670
[Legendary Fortune Teller]

08:10.080 --> 08:11.080
Fortune-teller,

08:11.860 --> 08:13.890
how much do you charge for a reading?

08:15.610 --> 08:16.870
No charge if I'm wrong.

08:16.910 --> 08:18.200
And if you're right?

08:18.220 --> 08:19.950
Pay whatever you think is fair.

08:24.960 --> 08:25.640
All right.

08:31.160 --> 08:31.810
Please.

08:48.680 --> 08:50.250
How do you interpret this reading?

08:50.250 --> 08:51.510
Your surname is Zhang,

08:52.490 --> 08:53.440
Z-h-a-n-g.

08:53.560 --> 08:54.360
That's right.

08:54.440 --> 08:55.640
My name is Zhang Feng.

08:55.640 --> 08:56.570
How did you know?

08:56.680 --> 08:57.520
Who are you

08:58.000 --> 08:58.920
asking about?

08:59.090 --> 08:59.760
My wife.

09:00.130 --> 09:02.260
Your wife's condition isn't serious.

09:02.640 --> 09:04.400
How did you know my wife was ill?

09:04.680 --> 09:06.330
Go north to seek medical treatment.

09:06.330 --> 09:07.330
That should do it.

09:08.400 --> 09:09.890
I just went to see a doctor north
of the city.

09:09.890 --> 09:10.490
You...

09:10.730 --> 09:12.100
You figured all that out from the reading?

09:12.100 --> 09:13.630
Hurry and get the medicine.

09:14.020 --> 09:16.950
Once she takes it,
the Zhang family will have an heir.

09:17.890 --> 09:18.400
Master,

09:18.400 --> 09:19.560
you're incredible!

09:19.590 --> 09:20.400
My wife hasn't gotten pregnant

09:20.400 --> 09:22.040
in two years!

09:22.250 --> 09:23.610
It's all fate.

09:23.890 --> 09:25.460
What is meant to come will come in time.

09:25.460 --> 09:26.940
Let me congratulate you in advance.

09:26.940 --> 09:27.800
Thank you, Master.

09:27.800 --> 09:28.860
Thank you, Master.

09:28.890 --> 09:30.370
Master, here's just a little token
of my appreciation.

09:30.370 --> 09:32.800
Thank you! Thank you!

09:32.800 --> 09:33.250
Congratulations, congratulations.

09:33.250 --> 09:34.610
Thank you, Master.

09:34.920 --> 09:36.640
Let's have the Master read ours, too.

09:36.640 --> 09:37.130
Master,

09:37.130 --> 09:38.640
read ours too, please.

09:52.930 --> 09:54.590
How did you get it all so right?

10:00.060 --> 10:02.190
I didn't tell his fortune. I observed.

10:02.420 --> 10:03.890
You could even tell his surname
through observation?

10:03.890 --> 10:05.050
There was something

10:05.670 --> 10:07.470
embroidered on his money pouch:

10:07.630 --> 10:08.490
"Bairen Hall."

10:09.280 --> 10:10.740
Everyone from Bairen Hall

10:10.930 --> 10:11.990
is surnamed Zhang.

10:13.090 --> 10:14.220
Then how did you know

10:14.540 --> 10:16.130
he was having his wife's fortune told,

10:16.130 --> 10:18.290
and that she was the one who was ill?

10:19.800 --> 10:21.930
I saw the prescription he was holding.

10:22.670 --> 10:25.500
Then how did you know
he was asking about having children?

10:25.500 --> 10:27.160
A husband asks about his wife.

10:27.370 --> 10:28.800
If the matter doesn't involve the wife,

10:28.800 --> 10:31.460
it must be about difficulties
having children.

10:37.330 --> 10:38.490
Then how did you know

10:38.650 --> 10:40.610
he was going north
to seek medical treatment?

10:40.610 --> 10:42.890
The wind was blowing from the south
when it rained.

10:42.890 --> 10:44.490
The front of his body was already dry,

10:44.490 --> 10:46.820
but his back and shoulders were still wet.

10:46.890 --> 10:49.890
So he must have been traveling
from south to north.

10:52.400 --> 10:55.000
You just got lucky
and happened to guess right.

11:02.530 --> 11:04.210
The tickets are already booked.

11:04.210 --> 11:05.410
We're leaving today.

11:05.660 --> 11:07.840
Now that we've finally built up
a bit of a reputation,

11:07.840 --> 11:10.760
why not keep setting up our stall
instead of leaving?

11:10.760 --> 11:12.130
Whether our readings are accurate or not,

11:12.130 --> 11:13.680
the future will tell.

11:14.210 --> 11:16.330
Maybe if we set up
our stall again tomorrow,

11:16.330 --> 11:18.210
someone will come and wreck it.

11:27.850 --> 11:28.610
Qianshan?

11:28.710 --> 11:29.570
Yes, Qianshan.

11:29.890 --> 11:30.800
Qianshan.

11:31.130 --> 11:33.500
[Qianshan Station]

11:31.670 --> 11:32.870
Looking for Blind Du?

11:33.390 --> 11:33.720
No.

11:34.160 --> 11:35.760
Wait for him to come find you.

11:42.490 --> 11:43.610
Slow down.

11:43.730 --> 11:44.330
All right,

11:44.400 --> 11:45.330
put it down here.

11:56.440 --> 11:57.040
Here it is.

11:57.610 --> 11:58.060
Master,

11:58.060 --> 11:59.270
you're finally back.

11:59.320 --> 12:00.730
The whole courtyard has been cleaned up.

12:00.730 --> 12:01.400
Have a look.

12:01.610 --> 12:02.210
Come here.

12:02.210 --> 12:03.010
Coming.

12:03.280 --> 12:04.880
This place is truly blessed.

12:05.090 --> 12:06.130
Over the next few days,

12:06.130 --> 12:08.280
I'll invite all kinds of immortals
to descend to the mortal world.

12:08.280 --> 12:10.640
Seven days from now, we'll hold
a ritual to honor the immortals.

12:10.640 --> 12:11.560
When the time comes,

12:11.560 --> 12:13.250
bring your friends and relatives

12:13.250 --> 12:14.760
and come pay your respects.

12:14.760 --> 12:15.680
All right.

12:15.680 --> 12:16.610
We'll all come.

12:16.610 --> 12:17.740
We definitely will,

12:18.440 --> 12:19.010
Master.

12:40.760 --> 12:42.440
Purple smoke!

12:42.520 --> 12:44.370
Is this the auspicious purple qi
coming from the east?

12:44.370 --> 12:45.560
This is a great omen!

12:45.730 --> 12:47.040
The immortals have answered our prayers!

12:47.040 --> 12:48.920
The immortals have answered our prayers!

12:48.920 --> 12:50.920
The immortals have answered our prayers!

12:50.920 --> 12:52.130
The immortals have answered our prayers!

12:52.130 --> 12:53.520
During these days
of inviting the immortals,

12:53.520 --> 12:54.970
the auspicious sign
of purple qi coming from the east

12:54.970 --> 12:56.170
can be seen every day.

12:56.330 --> 12:58.260
There's nothing unusual about it.

13:01.520 --> 13:02.520
The purple smoke

13:02.800 --> 13:03.890
will dissipate in an hour,

13:03.890 --> 13:05.090
and then it will rain.

13:06.850 --> 13:08.160
You'd better head home soon.

13:08.160 --> 13:09.760
The weather is so nice today.

13:09.850 --> 13:11.010
How could it rain?

13:11.090 --> 13:12.130
It definitely will.

13:12.130 --> 13:13.330
You have to trust him.

13:13.490 --> 13:15.280
He's a deity descended
to the mortal world.

13:15.280 --> 13:17.610
If he says it will rain,
you can bet it will.

13:29.280 --> 13:30.370
It's raining!

13:32.320 --> 13:33.640
It really is!

13:33.850 --> 13:35.160
It really is!

13:38.160 --> 13:39.760
I'll ask Master to read my fortune first.

13:39.760 --> 13:41.400
When will I be able to get married?

13:41.400 --> 13:42.040
Come on,

13:42.040 --> 13:43.370
let's have Master read ours too.

13:43.370 --> 13:43.970
Come on,

13:44.010 --> 13:44.610
come on.

13:44.730 --> 13:46.060
I'm going too. Let's go!

13:46.980 --> 13:49.110
[Yongzhen Taoist Temple]

13:51.800 --> 13:54.010
Come on, everyone.
This is Yongzhen Taoist Temple.

13:54.010 --> 13:55.090
A celestial being has descended
to the mortal realm.

13:55.090 --> 13:56.970
The purple smoke
is a great omen of good fortune.

13:56.970 --> 14:00.100
It's truly miraculous.
Hurry and go see for yourselves!

14:00.310 --> 14:03.510
♪ A, B, C, D, E ♪

14:03.540 --> 14:06.260
♪ Spouting nonsense endlessly ♪

14:06.290 --> 14:09.010
♪ Smoke and breath, drawn in and out ♪

14:09.040 --> 14:12.020
♪ Yellow paper charms,
half mad, half divine ♪

14:13.200 --> 14:15.350
♪ Heaven's Stems and Earthly Branches,
he waves them about ♪

14:16.000 --> 14:18.380
♪ Five Elements, Eight Trigrams,
all smoke and mirrors ♪

14:19.000 --> 14:21.200
♪ The fortune-teller's tongue
is full of lies ♪

14:21.230 --> 14:24.210
♪ Blows from the front,
arrows from behind, dark thoughts strike ♪

14:51.550 --> 14:52.220
Break!

14:56.280 --> 14:57.480
-It moved!
-It moved!

15:01.700 --> 15:03.360
Immortals, take your places.

15:05.730 --> 15:06.930
-It's lit!
-It's lit!

15:13.000 --> 15:15.560
Today, I gather
with the immortals for a feast,

15:15.560 --> 15:17.960
offering them Penglai longevity noodles.

15:17.990 --> 15:20.560
May the immortals bless the people

15:20.890 --> 15:22.890
of this land with peace and prosperity.

15:22.890 --> 15:23.890
I heard only a grandmaster

15:23.890 --> 15:25.850
with boundless powers

15:25.850 --> 15:27.730
could dine with the Immortals.

15:29.130 --> 15:30.330
Who is this kid?

15:46.800 --> 15:47.400
Look,

15:47.560 --> 15:48.890
he has finished eating.

15:57.330 --> 15:59.330
Can he really summon the Immortals?

15:59.330 --> 16:00.090
Just watch.

16:02.970 --> 16:03.630
Look, look!

16:05.940 --> 16:08.730
Thank you, Immortals,
for gracing us with your presence.

16:08.730 --> 16:10.990
The Immortals have finished the noodles

16:12.440 --> 16:14.370
and bestowed sacred water upon me.

16:16.040 --> 16:17.010
The Immortals

16:17.890 --> 16:19.090
really did finish them.

16:19.090 --> 16:20.490
Where did the noodles go?

16:22.160 --> 16:24.160
The sacred water falls to the earth,

16:28.600 --> 16:30.330
blessing generations to come.

16:31.430 --> 16:33.030
The noodles are really gone.

16:33.370 --> 16:34.230
Unbelievable!

16:34.610 --> 16:36.130
The noodles vanished

16:36.130 --> 16:37.040
in the blink of an eye.

16:37.040 --> 16:38.770
He is the only one
on that altar.

16:38.890 --> 16:40.280
Exactly, it's just him.

16:40.980 --> 16:43.100
Today, I've prepared

16:43.130 --> 16:44.530
some herbs for all of you.

16:44.680 --> 16:45.880
Don't worry about it.

16:46.290 --> 16:47.750
They're completely free.

16:47.920 --> 16:50.380
The Immortals have manifested themselves!

16:51.120 --> 16:52.730
The Immortals have manifested themselves!

16:52.730 --> 16:55.190
The Immortals have manifested themselves!

17:01.800 --> 17:03.280
Thank you.

18:03.090 --> 18:05.620
May I ask what manner of hero
I'm dealing with?

18:06.370 --> 18:08.050
Let's talk it out.

18:08.610 --> 18:10.090
There's no need for this.

18:11.960 --> 18:12.770
Turf?

18:28.680 --> 18:30.000
Pei County, Xuzhou.

18:31.290 --> 18:32.690
Who is your grandmaster?

18:33.400 --> 18:34.600
No gang. I work alone.

18:35.130 --> 18:35.850
Years in?

18:36.050 --> 18:36.480
Woof.

18:36.720 --> 18:37.850
Ever killed anyone?

18:37.850 --> 18:38.720
Never.

18:40.560 --> 18:45.200
[Blind Du, Grandmaster
of the Longxuya Branch, Tianxiang Sect]

18:50.970 --> 18:51.720
That trick of yours—

18:51.720 --> 18:53.200
the one where the Immortal
eats the noodles.

18:53.200 --> 18:54.370
How does it work?

18:55.200 --> 18:56.370
Tell me about it.

18:58.720 --> 19:01.530
A man doesn't give away
the secrets of his trade.

19:07.200 --> 19:09.400
You've got some nerve,

19:09.780 --> 19:12.910
setting up shop on my Longxuya turf.

19:13.000 --> 19:15.130
You think you're walking out of here alive

19:15.130 --> 19:17.130
without leaving something behind?

19:17.770 --> 19:20.030
I don't understand a word you're saying.

19:20.330 --> 19:21.160
Forget it.

19:21.440 --> 19:22.200
Drag him out

19:22.480 --> 19:24.050
and chop him up for the dogs.

19:24.130 --> 19:24.720
Yes.

19:26.440 --> 19:27.850
Six clashes turn into the noble Tianyi;

19:27.850 --> 19:29.480
stepping on Abao, untouched by dust.

19:29.480 --> 19:30.290
Hold on.

19:37.000 --> 19:39.160
So you're one of our own.

19:40.770 --> 19:41.530
Tell me,

19:41.920 --> 19:44.090
what brings you to see me?

19:44.700 --> 19:46.530
I just arrived in Qianshan from Pangzhou.

19:46.530 --> 19:47.730
With no one to turn to,

19:48.330 --> 19:50.440
I came to seek shelter
with the Longxuya Branch.

19:50.440 --> 19:51.290
Pangzhou?

19:52.400 --> 19:53.640
What's your name?

19:56.640 --> 19:58.440
I'm a 33rd-generation disciple
of the Muzilian Branch,

19:58.440 --> 19:59.330
Lyu Ruhui.

19:59.400 --> 20:01.000
I pay my respects, Master Du.

20:02.680 --> 20:03.960
Well.

20:04.570 --> 20:06.130
I was just looking for you.

20:06.570 --> 20:08.480
Look who came knocking.

20:09.670 --> 20:10.540
Hu Guangyuan,

20:10.600 --> 20:11.660
Song Bingzhang,

20:11.690 --> 20:12.250
Du Gui—

20:12.270 --> 20:13.230
you know them?

20:14.720 --> 20:15.440
I do.

20:17.370 --> 20:19.520
After stirring up such a commotion,

20:19.640 --> 20:21.640
you still dared to come to Qianshan?

20:21.890 --> 20:24.160
You've certainly got guts.

20:24.640 --> 20:26.440
With your tricks
of making the Immortals eat noodles

20:26.440 --> 20:28.170
and conjuring up purple smoke,

20:28.960 --> 20:30.640
you're quite the talent.

20:31.690 --> 20:33.420
If we'd met a few years earlier,

20:33.440 --> 20:36.400
I might really have
taken you on as a disciple.

20:37.130 --> 20:38.570
What a shame.

20:39.680 --> 20:40.370
Chief Du,

20:41.480 --> 20:43.740
I can explain what happened in Pangzhou.

20:44.000 --> 20:45.050
Four people are dead,

20:45.050 --> 20:46.090
and we lost so much money.

20:46.090 --> 20:47.160
How do you explain that?

20:47.160 --> 20:49.020
I have a way to make the money back.

20:49.160 --> 20:50.290
Please, Chief Du,

20:50.610 --> 20:51.610
give me a chance.

20:52.200 --> 20:53.330
A chance to do what?

20:56.400 --> 20:57.440
Do I tell you here?

21:03.400 --> 21:04.530
Everyone, leave us.

21:18.050 --> 21:19.000
Were you scared?

21:26.210 --> 21:27.450
Terrified.

21:28.000 --> 21:29.600
I nearly ended up as dog food.

21:31.640 --> 21:33.200
You weren't scared at all.

21:45.240 --> 21:46.130
Now tell me,

21:46.960 --> 21:49.760
what really happened
with that setup in Pangzhou?

21:52.610 --> 21:54.400
At first, everything went smoothly.

21:54.400 --> 21:56.480
That old man Chen Jiarong
fell for our story,

21:56.480 --> 21:59.210
and we got our hands
on the 50,000 silver dollars.

21:59.330 --> 22:00.000
But

22:00.440 --> 22:01.890
Master Hu and the others got greedy.

22:01.890 --> 22:03.400
They insisted on running another scheme,

22:03.400 --> 22:04.920
and that's when they slipped up.

22:04.920 --> 22:06.400
Chen Jiarong invited
the two masters to the mine

22:06.400 --> 22:08.130
under the pretext of signing a contract.

22:08.130 --> 22:09.370
Du Gui went with them.

22:10.330 --> 22:11.330
After that,

22:12.330 --> 22:13.990
we couldn't reach any of them.

22:14.530 --> 22:16.090
Then why didn't you go?

22:16.530 --> 22:17.640
The day it happened,

22:17.640 --> 22:19.500
I was out shopping with Miss Chen.

22:19.570 --> 22:21.530
My identity as Lin Shengxiang
hadn't been exposed,

22:21.530 --> 22:23.090
so I was still safe for the time being.

22:23.090 --> 22:23.810
Later,

22:24.050 --> 22:26.350
when I heard something
had happened at the mine,

22:26.350 --> 22:28.150
I fled Pangzhou that very night.

22:29.330 --> 22:31.460
Then why didn't you go back to Pujiang?

22:32.610 --> 22:33.570
I heard

22:34.240 --> 22:36.370
that your Longxuya Branch

22:36.680 --> 22:38.640
has been thriving here in Qianshan.

22:38.640 --> 22:40.640
So I took the liberty
of offering my services.

22:40.640 --> 22:42.090
I hope you'll take me in, Chief Du.

22:42.090 --> 22:44.860
Even if those four good-for-nothings

22:44.890 --> 22:46.860
botched the job
and it had nothing to do with you,

22:46.860 --> 22:49.380
plenty of people want to join my branch.

22:50.200 --> 22:51.570
Why should I take you in?

22:53.440 --> 22:55.200
Forgive me for speaking out of turn,

22:55.200 --> 22:56.870
but the Pangzhou operation failed

22:56.870 --> 22:58.140
because Hu Guangyuan and the others

22:58.140 --> 22:59.740
overestimated themselves.

23:00.290 --> 23:02.420
If you let me join the Longxuya Branch,

23:03.720 --> 23:05.580
I promise I won't disappoint you.

23:07.090 --> 23:09.050
Then I'd like to see

23:09.770 --> 23:11.530
what you're really capable of.

23:21.130 --> 23:22.000
Ruhui,

23:22.530 --> 23:24.370
you just joined the Longxuya Branch,

23:24.370 --> 23:25.640
and the Chief has assigned you to me.

23:25.640 --> 23:27.170
From now on, you're with me.

23:29.680 --> 23:30.410
Wow, not bad.

23:32.420 --> 23:35.680
[Silly Liang, Tianxiang Sect]

23:38.680 --> 23:40.680
You can't even handle spicy food,
yet you add that much of it.

23:40.680 --> 23:41.940
You don't understand.

23:42.050 --> 23:43.000
When you eat noodles out,

23:43.000 --> 23:44.050
chili's free.

23:45.090 --> 23:47.240
So you might as well
add as much as you can.

23:47.240 --> 23:48.000
You're...

23:48.910 --> 23:50.020
quite the genius.

23:50.470 --> 23:50.950
Really?

23:51.530 --> 23:52.330
I think so too.

23:52.530 --> 23:53.460
I don't know why,

23:53.960 --> 23:55.890
but everyone calls me Silly Liang.

23:56.610 --> 23:58.140
I'm actually pretty smart.

23:58.440 --> 24:00.810
If there's anything you don't understand,
just ask me.

24:00.810 --> 24:01.740
Anything at all.

24:07.770 --> 24:08.570
Go ahead, ask.

24:09.200 --> 24:10.800
I don't have anything to ask.

24:10.850 --> 24:12.480
Then let me tell you
about the Tianxiang Sect.

24:12.480 --> 24:13.000
No need.

24:13.090 --> 24:14.240
Our Tianxiang Sect

24:14.640 --> 24:15.920
has a main headquarters at the top,

24:15.920 --> 24:17.240
with branches underneath.

24:17.240 --> 24:18.960
Let's start with our Longxuya Branch.

24:18.960 --> 24:20.090
We're experts in fortune-telling

24:20.090 --> 24:21.530
and good at devising schemes.

24:21.530 --> 24:23.460
The girls of the Yuehaitang Branch

24:23.720 --> 24:25.640
specialize in conning wealthy men.

24:25.640 --> 24:26.720
As for the Xuemengcao Branch,

24:26.720 --> 24:27.530
they're something else.

24:27.530 --> 24:29.400
They make a living dealing with the dead.

24:29.400 --> 24:31.240
They've made a lot of money
these past two years,

24:31.240 --> 24:32.850
so they don't scam people much anymore.

24:32.850 --> 24:34.050
Then there's the Muzilian Branch.

24:34.050 --> 24:34.850
Boss,

24:36.670 --> 24:38.370
I used to be with the Muzilian Branch.

24:38.370 --> 24:38.810
Oh,

24:39.370 --> 24:40.570
right.

24:41.480 --> 24:42.050
In that case,

24:42.050 --> 24:44.250
let me tell you about the incantations.

24:44.640 --> 24:46.440
Read them first, then test them;

24:47.630 --> 24:49.230
strike fast, threaten slow.

24:49.770 --> 24:51.300
Flatter and close the deal;

24:51.640 --> 24:52.890
use every trick you know.

24:52.890 --> 24:54.490
Ten threats, nine will work.

24:54.680 --> 24:55.480
ten...

24:55.880 --> 24:58.700
[Eight years ago]

24:56.770 --> 24:57.640
Ten...

25:00.440 --> 25:02.400
Ten times with flattery, nine will win.

25:02.400 --> 25:04.200
Threaten first, then reassure.

25:04.330 --> 25:05.010
There's...

25:05.720 --> 25:07.320
There's no way you won't win.

25:09.880 --> 25:11.740
Threats without reassurance...

25:12.920 --> 25:15.090
Threats without reassurance...

25:15.920 --> 25:17.050
That's the mark of a fool.

25:17.050 --> 25:17.610
Exactly.

25:18.370 --> 25:19.300
How did you know?

25:20.290 --> 25:21.770
Isn't this basic incantation

25:21.770 --> 25:24.570
something every beginner
should have memorized?

25:24.570 --> 25:24.960
Yes.

25:25.440 --> 25:26.130
Yes.

25:34.050 --> 25:35.510
Let me get you a fresh bowl.

25:35.570 --> 25:36.170
It's on me.

25:36.290 --> 25:36.750
No need,

25:37.370 --> 25:38.770
no need. Just bring it as is.

25:38.770 --> 25:39.830
I can finish it all.

25:46.610 --> 25:47.530
Feels good.

25:49.440 --> 25:50.130
Ruhui,

25:50.640 --> 25:51.480
what were you

25:51.640 --> 25:53.700
and Chief Du babbling about earlier?

25:54.480 --> 25:55.290
Like,

25:55.680 --> 25:56.330
erm...

25:56.610 --> 25:57.330
"turf,"

25:57.640 --> 25:58.370
"years in,"

25:59.290 --> 26:01.000
and you even started barking like a dog.

26:01.000 --> 26:02.570
You don't know that either?

26:05.050 --> 26:07.250
"Turf" means asking where you're from.

26:07.530 --> 26:08.390
"Years in" asks

26:08.770 --> 26:10.630
how long you've been in the trade.

26:11.240 --> 26:12.440
As for that "woof,"

26:12.720 --> 26:14.160
it wasn't a dog bark, either.

26:14.160 --> 26:15.360
It means three years.

26:18.920 --> 26:19.480
Liang,

26:20.770 --> 26:23.430
how long have you been
with the Longxuya Branch?

26:23.770 --> 26:24.430
Woof, woof.

26:27.570 --> 26:28.630
Seriously, Liang,

26:29.850 --> 26:31.090
you're quite a talent.

26:31.090 --> 26:31.610
Right?

26:34.290 --> 26:34.720
Come on in,

26:34.720 --> 26:35.440
Ruhui.

26:45.810 --> 26:46.440
You

26:47.090 --> 26:47.950
take that room.

26:48.050 --> 26:49.110
I'll take this one.

26:50.850 --> 26:52.370
Master Du doesn't live with us?

26:52.370 --> 26:53.300
Are you kidding?

26:53.480 --> 26:54.850
He's the Chief of the Longxuya Branch.

26:54.850 --> 26:56.090
You think he'd live with us?

26:56.090 --> 26:58.000
His own courtyard in the back is huge.

26:58.000 --> 26:58.770
Get some sleep.

26:58.770 --> 26:59.770
See you tomorrow.

27:39.640 --> 27:40.890
I've had too much chili.

27:40.890 --> 27:42.160
Too much chili.

27:58.200 --> 27:58.770
Hurry!

28:04.370 --> 28:04.850
Move.

28:07.130 --> 28:07.730
All right,

28:07.810 --> 28:08.540
carry it out.

28:11.480 --> 28:12.440
Put it down.

28:19.160 --> 28:20.490
All right, carry it out.

28:21.330 --> 28:21.990
Bring it up.

28:22.210 --> 28:22.850
What's that smell?

28:22.850 --> 28:23.400
Hurry!

28:25.050 --> 28:25.850
Hurry!

28:26.000 --> 28:26.640
Come here.

28:29.850 --> 28:30.450
All right,

28:30.530 --> 28:31.260
carry it out.

28:43.890 --> 28:44.720
Easy, Sir.

28:45.000 --> 28:46.000
This way, please.

29:14.160 --> 29:15.130
Ruhui,

29:16.880 --> 29:17.750
Ruhui,

29:21.760 --> 29:23.160
why are you still asleep?

29:23.400 --> 29:24.270
Liang.

29:24.640 --> 29:25.220
Good morning.

29:25.220 --> 29:27.150
Morning? It's already afternoon.

29:27.200 --> 29:28.720
I have a bad habit of sleeping in.

29:28.720 --> 29:29.520
Don't mind me.

29:29.870 --> 29:31.060
Get dressed.

29:31.090 --> 29:32.020
Come out with me.

29:33.240 --> 29:34.770
Where are we working today,

29:35.000 --> 29:35.960
south of the city or north of the city?

29:35.960 --> 29:36.960
What business?

29:37.130 --> 29:39.130
We've got something to take care of.

29:40.270 --> 29:44.460
[Taiping Taoist Temple]

29:42.440 --> 29:42.920
Look.

29:43.370 --> 29:44.530
I checked out this Taiping Taoist Temple

29:44.530 --> 29:46.570
when I was looking for a place before.

29:46.570 --> 29:48.240
It's been abandoned for quite a while.

29:48.240 --> 29:50.100
Why are there so many people here?

29:52.290 --> 29:53.150
Excuse me, Sir,

29:53.720 --> 29:54.850
what's going on in there?

29:54.850 --> 29:55.610
Hurry and get inside.

29:55.610 --> 29:56.810
It'll be dark soon.

29:57.330 --> 29:57.850
Wait.

29:57.920 --> 29:58.850
What are we going in for?

29:58.850 --> 30:00.290
To offer incense, of course.

30:00.290 --> 30:02.050
Immortal Miaoxin has manifested herself.

30:02.050 --> 30:03.110
Haven't you heard?

30:03.610 --> 30:04.200
Hurry!

30:06.570 --> 30:08.000
Immortal Miaoxin?

30:09.130 --> 30:09.570
Okay.

30:10.370 --> 30:11.960
Copying me and staking a claim, huh?

30:11.960 --> 30:12.960
Come on, let's go take a look.

30:12.960 --> 30:13.570
Let's go.

30:14.240 --> 30:15.310
Coming through, coming through.

30:15.310 --> 30:16.510
Thank you, thank you.

30:16.640 --> 30:17.430
Thank you.

30:17.610 --> 30:19.330
Coming through.

30:19.610 --> 30:20.210
Thank you.

30:20.290 --> 30:21.890
Excuse me.

30:21.960 --> 30:23.290
Thank you.

30:25.480 --> 30:26.050
Thank you, Ma'am.

30:26.050 --> 30:26.960
Thank you.

30:28.160 --> 30:29.050
Sorry.

30:33.530 --> 30:35.060
Boundless Heavenly Honor.

30:35.850 --> 30:37.380
Boundless Heavenly Honor.

30:37.960 --> 30:39.360
Boundless Heavenly Honor.

30:39.360 --> 30:40.380
Two bucks for thick incense,

30:40.380 --> 30:41.450
one for thin.

30:42.000 --> 30:43.600
That's some pricey incense.

30:44.330 --> 30:45.610
Whether you find it expensive

30:45.610 --> 30:46.720
depends on

30:46.850 --> 30:48.000
how sincere you are.

30:48.330 --> 30:48.960
Exactly.

30:49.330 --> 30:51.200
See that statue of Immortal Miaoxin?

30:51.200 --> 30:53.050
It rises another inch
above the ground every day.

30:53.050 --> 30:54.810
As long as we worship with sincere hearts,

30:54.810 --> 30:56.330
in 49 days,

30:56.440 --> 30:57.570
Immortal Miaoxin
will emerge from the earth

30:57.570 --> 30:59.100
and bless the local people.

30:59.160 --> 31:00.620
The more incense we offer,

31:00.770 --> 31:02.200
the greater the blessings.

31:02.200 --> 31:03.580
Really?

31:03.610 --> 31:04.810
You don't believe me?

31:05.530 --> 31:06.160
Young man,

31:06.290 --> 31:07.760
I've seen it with my own eyes.

31:07.760 --> 31:08.440
In just half a day,

31:08.440 --> 31:09.640
the statue has already

31:09.640 --> 31:11.050
emerged quite a bit.

31:13.440 --> 31:14.400
Excuse me,

31:14.720 --> 31:15.960
if I may ask,

31:16.240 --> 31:18.130
who exactly is this immortal?

31:18.480 --> 31:20.680
How come I've never heard of her before?

31:20.810 --> 31:22.130
Are you offering incense or not?

31:22.130 --> 31:23.530
Don't be disrespectful.

31:23.680 --> 31:25.340
You'll disturb the Immortal.

31:25.530 --> 31:26.240
I will.

31:26.530 --> 31:27.460
Of course I will.

31:28.720 --> 31:30.320
Put your incense money here.

31:33.290 --> 31:33.770
What are you doing?

31:33.770 --> 31:34.570
What, you bought me a bowl of noodles

31:34.570 --> 31:35.530
and want the money back?

31:35.530 --> 31:37.530
I'm borrowing it, aren't I? It's not like
I'm not going to pay you back.

31:37.530 --> 31:37.960
Wait,

31:38.090 --> 31:39.440
it's not that I'm being stingy.

31:39.440 --> 31:40.890
I need this money tonight.

31:40.890 --> 31:41.720
Tonight?

31:41.800 --> 31:43.330
Then we'll deal with it tonight.

31:43.330 --> 31:43.960
What are you doing?

31:43.960 --> 31:45.220
You're robbing me now?

31:48.330 --> 31:49.390
What are you doing?

31:50.000 --> 31:51.060
What are you doing?

31:55.930 --> 31:56.920
You insolent boy.

31:56.920 --> 31:59.290
You're showing disrespect to the Immortal.

31:59.290 --> 32:00.240
I'm sorry.

32:01.000 --> 32:03.130
But why are there so many bean sprouts?

32:04.770 --> 32:05.570
Bean sprouts?

32:08.000 --> 32:09.050
I get it.

32:09.130 --> 32:10.810
They buried soybeans ahead of time,

32:10.810 --> 32:11.890
let them sprout,

32:11.960 --> 32:14.770
and the growing sprouts pushed the statue
out of the ground.

32:14.770 --> 32:16.570
He's probably a fraud.

32:27.130 --> 32:28.130
Easy,

32:28.130 --> 32:29.440
easy!

32:43.130 --> 32:44.200
Easy!

32:44.370 --> 32:45.440
Easy!

32:48.160 --> 32:49.610
Easy!

32:52.500 --> 32:53.740
Ruhui,

32:54.000 --> 32:56.460
how did you figure out
how they were doing it?

32:56.920 --> 32:58.960
These cheap tricks for fooling children

32:58.960 --> 33:00.330
are nothing new to me.

33:00.950 --> 33:02.530
What about that auspicious purple smoke?

33:02.530 --> 33:03.590
How did you do that?

33:03.610 --> 33:04.810
Get some iodine

33:04.850 --> 33:05.650
and aluminum,

33:05.900 --> 33:07.290
and throw them into water together.

33:07.290 --> 33:08.890
It'll produce purple smoke.

33:09.530 --> 33:10.370
And...

33:10.920 --> 33:13.090
what about that trick
where the Immortals ate the noodles?

33:13.090 --> 33:14.750
That trick looks mysterious,

33:15.000 --> 33:16.290
but it's actually incredibly simple.

33:16.290 --> 33:17.130
Simply put,

33:17.400 --> 33:18.130
it's honey.

33:18.160 --> 33:18.770
Honey?

33:18.890 --> 33:20.610
Honey contains an enzyme called amylase

33:20.610 --> 33:22.140
that can break down starch.

33:22.160 --> 33:23.890
I put honey in those Immortals' bowls

33:23.890 --> 33:24.720
beforehand.

33:25.000 --> 33:25.770
By the time I finished my noodles,

33:25.770 --> 33:26.960
exactly 15 minutes had passed,

33:26.960 --> 33:28.130
and the noodles in that bowl

33:28.130 --> 33:29.660
had completely dissolved.

33:31.090 --> 33:31.820
What enzyme?

33:32.810 --> 33:33.850
Amylase.

33:34.610 --> 33:36.870
It's something Westerners discovered.

33:39.290 --> 33:40.200
An enzyme?

33:41.240 --> 33:42.370
Don't overthink it.

33:43.090 --> 33:44.000
Just remember,

33:44.330 --> 33:45.290
it was the honey.

33:47.000 --> 33:47.770
Either way,

33:48.000 --> 33:48.720
you did

33:48.770 --> 33:49.770
a great job today.

33:50.610 --> 33:51.330
Ruhui,

33:51.530 --> 33:52.330
from now on,

33:52.550 --> 33:55.550
you're officially a disciple
of the Longxuya Branch.

33:57.770 --> 33:58.920
Thanks for taking me
under your wing, Liang.

33:58.920 --> 33:59.810
All right.

34:00.530 --> 34:02.770
Tonight, I'll show you a thing or two

34:03.720 --> 34:05.320
and celebrate your success.

34:05.810 --> 34:06.890
In our branch,

34:07.000 --> 34:08.290
only those who've done great deeds

34:08.290 --> 34:10.219
get to come to this pleasure house.

34:10.560 --> 34:11.290
Liang,

34:12.920 --> 34:14.210
how many times have you been here?

34:14.210 --> 34:14.690
Me?

34:15.170 --> 34:16.230
I come every month.

34:16.600 --> 34:17.530
I'm telling you,

34:17.889 --> 34:19.290
we're the big shots here.

34:19.440 --> 34:21.239
These girls are here to serve us.

34:21.250 --> 34:22.560
Don't be so shy.

34:22.600 --> 34:22.960
Let's go.

34:22.960 --> 34:23.650
Wait, wait.

34:26.110 --> 34:26.949
This doesn't feel right.

34:26.949 --> 34:28.040
What's wrong with it?

34:28.040 --> 34:29.040
I've seen them...

34:29.690 --> 34:31.000
This is how I've always done it.

34:31.000 --> 34:31.929
Come on, come on.

34:32.480 --> 34:33.010
Let's go.

34:34.480 --> 34:35.340
Right this way.

34:35.730 --> 34:36.040
Go ahead.

34:36.040 --> 34:37.520
You first.

34:38.440 --> 34:39.300
No, no,

34:39.330 --> 34:40.330
I'll go myself.

34:45.250 --> 34:45.850
Sir,

34:46.810 --> 34:47.690
please.

35:02.690 --> 35:03.440
So,

35:05.690 --> 35:07.090
how old are you this year?

35:08.520 --> 35:09.450
I'm 14 years old.

35:15.280 --> 35:16.220
Wait, wait.

35:23.370 --> 35:24.700
I've had too much to drink.

35:24.700 --> 35:25.570
Mind if I rest here

35:25.570 --> 35:26.420
for a bit?

35:26.520 --> 35:27.370
Make yourself comfortable.

35:27.370 --> 35:28.810
Just wake me

35:28.920 --> 35:30.380
when my friend is leaving.

35:54.480 --> 35:55.480
Ruhui,

35:56.000 --> 35:57.690
how was your night?

35:59.210 --> 35:59.940
Pretty good.

36:00.040 --> 36:00.770
Pretty good.

36:01.600 --> 36:02.250
Liang,

36:02.400 --> 36:03.250
what about your?

36:03.250 --> 36:04.370
Mine was pretty good too.

36:04.370 --> 36:05.210
Ruhui,

36:07.110 --> 36:08.570
the Chief wants to see you.

36:09.210 --> 36:10.850
The Chief is probably
going to reward you.

36:10.850 --> 36:11.910
I'll come with you.

36:12.480 --> 36:13.280
The Chief said

36:13.690 --> 36:15.220
he wants only Ruhui to come.

36:18.520 --> 36:19.050
Let's go.

36:31.520 --> 36:32.210
Go in.

37:07.120 --> 37:09.600
There's a little phosphorus powder
in the candle wick.

37:09.600 --> 37:10.660
Just a cheap trick.

37:11.250 --> 37:14.120
Nothing compared to your earlier tricks.

37:17.210 --> 37:19.210
Chief, you summoned me here so late.

37:19.290 --> 37:20.420
What can I do for you?

37:21.960 --> 37:22.850
Why

37:23.560 --> 37:24.850
didn't you do it?

37:25.910 --> 37:26.800
Do what?

37:27.920 --> 37:29.370
With that girl.

37:33.170 --> 37:34.300
You know about that?

37:35.170 --> 37:37.650
As the head of this branch,

37:38.250 --> 37:40.910
I have to have a few eyes
and ears around, don't I?

37:42.440 --> 37:45.560
I heard you took down another claim.

37:46.560 --> 37:47.560
Nicely done.

37:48.850 --> 37:50.650
Thank you for the praise, Chief.

37:52.250 --> 37:53.170
Ruhui,

37:53.690 --> 37:55.850
what do you think of me?

37:56.560 --> 37:57.290
Pretty good.

37:58.170 --> 37:58.890
Pretty good.

37:58.890 --> 37:59.960
Pretty good?

38:01.480 --> 38:03.330
Am I good at deceiving people,

38:03.440 --> 38:05.170
or good at killing them?

38:06.850 --> 38:07.520
Tell me,

38:08.730 --> 38:10.080
if someone

38:11.480 --> 38:15.340
were playing tricks and pretending
to be supernatural in our branch,

38:15.650 --> 38:17.040
trying to kill me,

38:19.120 --> 38:20.720
what do you think I should do?

38:23.080 --> 38:25.340
I don't understand what you mean, Chief.

38:27.960 --> 38:28.730
Pick it up.

38:35.600 --> 38:36.330
Why don't I

38:36.850 --> 38:39.440
take you as my final disciple?

38:40.120 --> 38:41.850
I'm not worthy of such an honor.

38:42.330 --> 38:44.330
If I say you're worthy, then you are.

38:45.080 --> 38:45.890
But

38:46.600 --> 38:49.260
if you're going
to be Blind Du's final disciple,

38:49.520 --> 38:51.650
you'll have to be a blind man yourself.

38:51.690 --> 38:53.440
You have to use the knife in your hand

38:53.440 --> 38:55.330
to cut out your own eyes.

38:56.730 --> 38:57.660
Don't be afraid.

38:58.170 --> 39:00.080
Just bear it for a moment,
and it'll be over.

39:00.080 --> 39:02.250
If you really
can't bring yourself to do it...

39:02.250 --> 39:04.400
Your fate is marked by raging Fire,

39:04.600 --> 39:07.530
while Miss Feiyan
is destined to be ill-fated Water.

39:07.600 --> 39:09.440
Water and Fire are naturally incompatible.

39:09.440 --> 39:12.120
If the two of you insist
on being together,

39:12.330 --> 39:14.210
disaster will surely befall your family.

39:14.210 --> 39:15.470
What kind of disaster?

39:15.730 --> 39:16.890
Your entire family

39:17.690 --> 39:19.290
will be dead within a month.

39:21.290 --> 39:23.960
Blind Du made me do it.

39:24.520 --> 39:27.930
Southern Immortal Elder wants to take them
as immortal children.

39:27.930 --> 39:30.520
How could mere mortals like us
hope to stop him?

39:30.520 --> 39:32.170
What can I do

39:32.810 --> 39:35.040
to get revenge on the Tianxiang Sect?

39:35.650 --> 39:37.040
If you want revenge,

39:37.370 --> 39:39.000
you have to know the Tianxiang Sect

39:39.000 --> 39:40.650
better than anyone.

39:41.080 --> 39:42.370
You have to predict

39:42.440 --> 39:43.690
their every move

39:44.120 --> 39:45.690
and see through every scheme they make.

39:45.690 --> 39:46.690
Only then

39:48.600 --> 39:50.060
can you have your revenge.

39:53.520 --> 39:54.120
What?

39:54.520 --> 39:55.520
You don't want to?

39:55.960 --> 39:58.090
Do you look down on my Longxuya Branch?

39:59.290 --> 40:00.090
Of course not.

40:00.290 --> 40:02.080
It's just that I already have a mentor.

40:02.080 --> 40:03.560
The Tianxiang Sect has its rules.

40:03.560 --> 40:04.960
Changing allegiance
without your mentor's permission

40:04.960 --> 40:06.370
would be no different

40:06.650 --> 40:09.040
from betraying your mentor
and forsaking your sect.

40:09.040 --> 40:11.290
How could I, Ruhui,
be so disloyal and unfilial?

40:11.290 --> 40:13.150
I hope you'll understand, Chief.

40:13.850 --> 40:15.600
Then who is your mentor?

40:17.120 --> 40:17.920
Jin Buhuan.

40:18.770 --> 40:19.560
Could you

40:19.730 --> 40:21.530
arrange for us to meet sometime?

40:24.520 --> 40:25.770
Certainly.

40:28.650 --> 40:29.920
The road ahead

40:29.920 --> 40:31.380
is like brewing medicine—

40:31.730 --> 40:33.250
it takes patience

40:33.730 --> 40:35.460
and a slow simmer over low heat.

40:35.520 --> 40:36.600
Lyu Ruhui

40:36.850 --> 40:38.370
loves lurking in dark places,

40:38.370 --> 40:40.370
like a bat that can't stand the sun.

40:41.290 --> 40:42.170
He killed

40:42.290 --> 40:44.150
your younger siblings back then,

40:44.770 --> 40:46.600
but he never saw your face.

40:47.560 --> 40:48.760
This dose of bat guano

40:49.100 --> 40:50.370
is perfect for him.

40:51.560 --> 40:53.690
This one needs a quick boil
over high heat.

40:53.690 --> 40:54.820
Swift and decisive.

40:59.080 --> 41:00.370
This cinnabar,

41:00.600 --> 41:02.520
red as blood,

41:03.250 --> 41:04.380
is for Old Madam Zhu.

41:04.400 --> 41:05.800
It'll add a touch of color

41:05.890 --> 41:07.330
to her rouge.

41:07.920 --> 41:08.730
Bring it

41:08.920 --> 41:11.250
to a rapid boil over high heat,

41:11.440 --> 41:12.690
then add the medicine and stir gently

41:12.690 --> 41:14.120
along the rising steam from the pot.

41:14.120 --> 41:15.730
Don't let her get away.

41:20.650 --> 41:22.290
As for Blind Du,

41:23.370 --> 41:24.400
this cassia seed

41:25.000 --> 41:26.530
should help clear his eyes.

41:36.290 --> 41:37.690
What about Jiang Feiyan?

41:39.960 --> 41:42.360
She's the one I want
to get my hands on first.

41:46.960 --> 41:48.890
This medicine is unstable.

41:49.690 --> 41:51.350
If you can't control the heat,

41:51.730 --> 41:52.990
it'll turn poisonous.

41:53.730 --> 41:54.930
So remember:

41:55.000 --> 41:57.460
the later you prepare this dose,
the better.

42:25.690 --> 42:27.870
[In the next episode]

42:28.080 --> 42:30.200
Copper bells lead the way

42:30.590 --> 42:32.700
as the dead are escorted home.

42:33.030 --> 42:34.690
One of the corpses has turned!

42:35.220 --> 42:36.720
When a corpse turns on the way home,

42:36.720 --> 42:38.280
it's either because the dead
bore a grievance in life

42:38.280 --> 42:39.730
or met with misfortune after death.

42:39.730 --> 42:41.090
You're dressed

42:41.530 --> 42:43.180
as if you were about to perform in a play.

42:43.180 --> 42:44.710
I'll put you somewhere else

42:44.740 --> 42:46.180
so you can cool off.

42:50.920 --> 42:52.600
Everyone who's ever been good to me

42:52.600 --> 42:53.840
ends up

42:54.010 --> 42:55.490
dead because of me.
